      "title": "The sum over near terms on the moderate region",
      "statement": "The integral of the nonidentity near absolute sum is at most M exp(−U/4) for U=nf log n. The cost of integrating each of the a flag sizes is absorbed by the arithmetic gain for total isotropic rank J. Summing the 2^q−1 ordered rank types spends one further exponential factor.",
